### ============================================
### PayPro - payment-service - Pruebas locales
### Requiere: account-service (8081), provider-service (8082),
### notification-service (8083) y payment-service (8080) corriendo.
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = secret123

### 1. Registrar usuario (solo una vez)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alfonso",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login - copia el "token" de la respuesta y pégalo en @token abajo
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alfonso",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ⬇️ Pega aquí el JWT obtenido en el paso 2
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbGZvbnNvIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgzOTEzNjYyLCJleHAiOjE3ODQwMDAwNjJ9.FZhPZ1M_17aVo2vL2nAA8Df9YJPYlTROdid0bRup_hj0kEXcy6Fj8veQNtMKtJ_0BkNW6ghP013wpvz6JdtguQ

### ============================================
### CASOS DE PRUEBA
### ============================================

### Caso 1: Pago aprobado (tarjeta válida, saldo suficiente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "merchant": "Tienda Test",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "cardNumber": "4532015112830366"
}

### Caso 2: Tarjeta bloqueada -> REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "merchant": "Tienda Test",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "cardNumber": "4111111111111111"
}

### Caso 3: Monto excede límite ($10,000) -> REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "merchant": "Tienda Test",
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "cardNumber": "4532015112830366"
}

### Caso 4: Red de tarjeta no soportada (Amex/Discover) -> REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "merchant": "Tienda Test",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "cardNumber": "6011000000000000"
}

### Caso 5: Saldo insuficiente (Tienda B tiene solo 100 MXN) -> REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "merchant": "Tienda B",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "cardNumber": "4532015112830366"
}

### ============================================
### Consultas
### ============================================

### Listar todos los pagos
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener pago por ID (cambia el 1 según corresponda)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
